        "quote": "(a) Policy Statement. It is the policy of the City to provide equal opportunity when employing individuals and not to discriminate against any individual based on his/her age, color, disability, familial status, genetic information, national origin, ancestry, race, religion, sex which includes gender identity and sexual orientation per the United States Supreme Court in Bostock v. Clayton County Georgia 590 U.S. 644 (2020), veteran status or any other factor protected by law (“protected class”). This shall apply to all personnel actions and procedures including, but not limited to, recruitment, hiring, training, transfer, promotion, compensation and other benefits.",
